    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Yes, this was a font-metric problem. The triangle was geometrically centered, but FF8's uppercase ink center sat 152 font units above the declared line-box center. It is the same class of problem as RDR Lino, but from independent metrics in the FF8-generated face. I corrected FF8 Menu once at the font-face level, so tabs, tables, headers, and controls all move together. Hidden renders passed at 1280×720 and 1600×900.",
